# {{PROJECT_NAME}}

Playwright JavaScript {{FRAMEWORK}} {{TESTING_TYPE}} framework. Edit `config/run.config.json` and run `npm test`. In BDD, run one feature with `npm test login.feature`; otherwise run `npm test login.spec.js`. Run a tag with `npm test -- --tag @smoke`. Any `test-data/<environment>.json` file is discovered automatically. Reusable methods live in `utils/CommonMethods.js`; failures retain traces under `test-results/` and errors in `reports/errors.log`.
